  "description": "Everyone has a story. What about the dead, especially? Here, there's a radio station that comforts them. Sky Blue Radio introduces the diverse stories of the deceased. Sky Blue Radio's DJ, Sky, grants their wishes in return for sharing their stories... The sad and cruel stories of the deceased with their diverse stories. \n\n *\"What is your wish?\"*\n\n(Source: Naver Series, translated)",
